  "description": "Unofficial MCP server for Polish public registers: company lookup (KRS + VAT whitelist), the optional GUS REGON register (needs your own GUS key), bank-account whitelist checks, cadastral parcel lookup and address geocoding (GUGiK ULDK and UUG), real-estate transaction prices (RCN, GUGiK), and offline validation of NIP, REGON, KRS, NRB and KW numbers. Not affiliated with the Polish government. Run: dotnet dnx PolishOpenData.Mcp --yes",
